this is the vibe-coding-based minesweeper-bot project

## code defects#
the current implementation version can only run on a specific mine-sweeping window size

##start it by yourself#

For anyone who want to run the code in win8 and above, please download the win7 package (https://win7game.com) Warning, please make sure the package is virus-free!!!

I use python to implement it and I look forward to someone trying the implementation version of other languages



